  ('HORIBA-LAQUATWIN-ORP-11', 'HORIBA LAQUAtwin ORP-11 ORP Pocket Meter', 'horiba-laquatwin-orp-11-orp-pocket-meter', 'The HORIBA LAQUAtwin ORP-11 is a compact, IP67 waterproof orp pocket meter with HORIBA''s flat sensor, so a single drop of sample is enough. Made in Japan. Supplied with 225 mV ORP standard (14 mL), abrasive cotton swab, sampling sheet B (5 pcs), CR2032 batteries (2), dropper, manuals and storage case.', '[["Model", "ORP-11"], ["Part no.", "3200965260"], ["Principle", "ORP electrode, platinum disk sensor"], ["Min. sample", "0.3 mL (0.05 mL with sampling sheet B)"], ["mV range / resolution", "-1000 to 1000 mV / 1 mV"], ["Accuracy", "±2 mV"], ["Calibration", "1 point, 225 mV"], ["Temperature display", "0 to 50.0 °C / 0.1 °C"], ["Functions", "ORP and Eh measurement, automatic standard recognition, auto / custom calibration value"], ["Supplied with", "225 mV ORP standard (14 mL), abrasive cotton swab, sampling sheet B (5 pcs), 2 × CR2032 batteries, dropper, manuals, storage case"], ["Display", "Custom monochrome digital LCD with backlight"], ["Operating conditions", "5 to 40 °C, ≤ 85 % RH (no condensation)"], ["Battery life", "Approx. 400 h continuous use without backlight (2 × CR2032)"], ["Protection", "IP67 waterproof and dustproof"], ["Dimensions", "164 × 29 × 20 mm (excluding projections)"], ["Warranty", "2 years"], ["Made in", "Japan"]]', '["Measures from a single drop: as little as 0.1 mL (0.05 mL with sampling sheet B)", "Flat sensor: test liquids, solids, powders, paper and films, or scoop and immerse", "One-button calibration and measurement; smiley face shows a stable reading", "IP67 waterproof and dustproof, with backlit display", "Replaceable sensor", "Auto Hold / Auto Stable, auto power-off (30 min), low battery indicator", "Comes in a carrying case with calibration solutions"]', 'environmental-equipment', '/products/horiba/laquatwin-orp.jpg'),
