  ('HORIBA-LAQUATWIN-SALT-11', 'HORIBA LAQUAtwin Salt-11 Salt (NaCl) Pocket Meter', 'horiba-laquatwin-salt-11-salt-nacl-pocket-meter', 'The HORIBA LAQUAtwin Salt-11 is a compact, IP67 waterproof salt (nacl) pocket meter with HORIBA''s flat sensor, so a single drop of sample is enough. Made in Japan. Supplied with 0.5 % and 5.0 % NaCl standards (14 mL each), conditioning solution (4 mL), CR2032 batteries (2), dropper, manuals and storage case.', '[["Model", "Salt-11"], ["Part no.", "3999960128"], ["Salt range", "0.0 to 100.0 g/L (0.1 g/L); 0.00 to 10.00 % (0.01 %)"], ["Accuracy", "±2 % full scale (0.0 to 9.9 g/L); ±4 % full scale (10.0 to 100.0 g/L)"], ["Calibration points", "Up to 2"], ["Salt curves", "NaCl / sea water"], ["Temperature display", "0 to 50.0 °C / 0.1 °C"], ["Principle", "2-electrode bipolar AC; titanium sensor coated with platinum black"], ["Min. sample", "0.12 mL"], ["Supplied with", "0.5 % and 5.0 % NaCl standards (14 mL each), conditioning solution (4 mL), 2 × CR2032 batteries, dropper, manuals, storage case"], ["Display", "Custom monochrome digital LCD with backlight"], ["Operating conditions", "5 to 40 °C, ≤ 85 % RH (no condensation)"], ["Battery life", "Approx. 400 h continuous use without backlight (2 × CR2032)"], ["Protection", "IP67 waterproof and dustproof"], ["Dimensions", "164 × 29 × 20 mm (excluding projections)"], ["Warranty", "2 years"], ["Made in", "Japan"]]', '["Measures from a single drop: as little as 0.1 mL (0.05 mL with sampling sheet B)", "Flat sensor: test liquids, solids, powders, paper and films, or scoop and immerse", "One-button calibration and measurement; smiley face shows a stable reading", "IP67 waterproof and dustproof, with backlit display", "Replaceable sensor", "Auto Hold / Auto Stable, auto power-off (30 min), low battery indicator", "Comes in a carrying case with calibration solutions"]', 'environmental-equipment', '/products/horiba/laquatwin-salt.jpg'),
