  ('HORIBA-LAQUATWIN-F-11', 'HORIBA LAQUAtwin F-11 Fluoride Ion (F-) Pocket Meter', 'horiba-laquatwin-f-11-fluoride-ion-f-pocket-meter', 'The HORIBA LAQUAtwin F-11 is a compact, IP67 waterproof fluoride ion (f-) pocket meter with HORIBA''s flat sensor, so a single drop of sample is enough. Made in Japan. Supplied with 1 and 10 ppm fluoride standards (14 mL each), TISAB (14 mL), 5 mL beaker, syringe, sampling sheet B (5 pcs), CR2032 batteries (2), dropper, manuals and storage case.', '[["Model", "F-11"], ["Part no.", "3200934412"], ["Principle", "Ion selective electrode, LaF3 crystal sensor"], ["Min. sample", "0.3 mL (0.1 mL with sampling sheet B)"], ["Range", "0.1 to 990 ppm"], ["Resolution", "0.1 to 9.9 ppm: 0.1 ppm; 10 to 99 ppm: 1 ppm; 100 to 990 ppm: 10 ppm"], ["Accuracy", "±2 % of actual value"], ["Calibration points", "Up to 2"], ["Temperature display", "0 to 50.0 °C / 0.1 °C"], ["Functions", "Automatic standard recognition, changeable low/high calibration values, temperature calibration, multiplying compensation (0.01 to 9.90), Auto Hold / Auto Stable"], ["Supplied with", "1 and 10 ppm fluoride standards (14 mL each), TISAB (14 mL), 5 mL beaker, syringe, sampling sheet B (5 pcs), 2 × CR2032 batteries, dropper, manuals, storage case"], ["Display", "Custom monochrome digital LCD with backlight"], ["Operating conditions", "5 to 40 °C, ≤ 85 % RH (no condensation)"], ["Battery life", "Approx. 400 h continuous use without backlight (2 × CR2032)"], ["Protection", "IP67 waterproof and dustproof"], ["Dimensions", "164 × 29 × 20 mm (excluding projections)"], ["Warranty", "2 years"], ["Made in", "Japan"]]', '["Measures from a single drop: as little as 0.1 mL (0.05 mL with sampling sheet B)", "Flat sensor: test liquids, solids, powders, paper and films, or scoop and immerse", "One-button calibration and measurement; smiley face shows a stable reading", "IP67 waterproof and dustproof, with backlit display", "Replaceable sensor", "Auto Hold / Auto Stable, auto power-off (3